{#
  Site Footer

  Global footer included at the bottom of every page via the base layout.
  Displays a short credit paragraph attributing Zasqua to Neogranadina and
  the Archives, Memory and Preservation Lab (AMPL) at UC Santa Barbara,
  followed by the copyright line, a link to the current release's GitHub
  tag, and the most recent build date. The version number and build date
  come from `site.js`, so they update automatically each time the site is
  rebuilt. Two institutional logos sit on the right.

  Version: v0.5.0
#}
<footer class="site-footer bg-burgundy-dark text-white">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="footer-left text-sm">
      <p>Zasqua es una plataforma de consulta de materiales de archivo desarrollada por <a href="https://neogranadina.org" target="_blank" class="text-white font-semibold hover:text-periwinkle">Neogranadina</a> y el <a href="https://ampl.clair.ucsb.edu" target="_blank" class="text-white font-semibold hover:text-periwinkle">Laboratorio de Archivos, Memoria y Preservación (AMPL)</a> de la Universidad de California, Santa Barbara.</p>
      <p class="footer-copyright">{{ ui.footer.copyright | replace("{year}", site.buildYear) }}.
      <br><a href="https://github.com/neogranadina/zasqua-frontend/releases/tag/v{{ site.version }}" class="text-white hover:text-periwinkle">Zasqua v{{ site.version }}</a>. Última actualización: {{ site.buildDate }}.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="footer-right">
      <img src="/img/logo_grande.svg" alt="Neogranadina" class="footer-seal">
      <img src="/img/ampl-cropped-1.png" alt="AMP Lab, UC Santa Barbara" class="footer-seal">
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
